  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Central Bank of India (CBI) has released the notification for the post of Specialist Officers (SO) in IT and other streams on a regular basis. This recruitment has been issued for 223 posts. Candidates Can Also Check All Details on Official<a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">&nbsp;Sarkari Result 2025</a> website which is SarkariExam.com</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Central Bank of India (CBI)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Central Bank of India Specialist Officer (SO) Recruitment 2024</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Notification Date : <strong>18 November 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Application Start Date : <strong>18 November 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>03 December 2024</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>03 December 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Exam Date : <strong>14 December 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li>Interview Date : <strong>2nd Week Of January 2025</strong></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Admit Card : <strong>Before Exam</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>General, EWS, OBC&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>: Rs. 850/- + GST</strong></li>\n<li>SC, BC, PWBD Female <strong>: Rs. 175- + GST</strong></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>NA</strong></li>\n<li>Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>NA</strong></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Relaxation as per Central Bank Specialist Officer Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li>Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 253 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Post Name&nbsp;</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><strong>No. Of Post</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\">Assistant Manager</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\">25</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\">Manager</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\">162</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\">Senior Manager</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\">56</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\">Chief Manager</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\">10</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Post WiSE vACANCY dETAILS</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Scale</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Total&nbsp;</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\">UI/UX Designer</td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\">III/II</td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\">03</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\">Java Developer</td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\">III/II</td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\">23</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\">COBOL Developer</td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\">III/II</td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\">05</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\">Network Administrator</td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\">III/II</td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\">13</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\">Database Administrator</td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\">III/II</td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\">09</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\">IT Security Analyst</td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\">III/II</td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\">17</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\">Data Scientist</td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\">III/II</td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\">04</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.8362%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.1638%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Eligibility</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.8362%; text-align: center;\">Assistant Manager</td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.1638%;\">\n<ul>\n<li>Bachelor’s degree in relevant fields such as IT or Electronics.</li>\n<li>Freshers with strong academic records can apply.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.8362%; text-align: center;\">Manager</td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.1638%;\">\n<ul>\n<li>Graduate/Postgraduate in Computer Science, IT, or related field.</li>\n<li>At least 2 years of experience in database management, coding, or cloud technologies.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.8362%; text-align: center;\">Senior Manager</td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.1638%;\">\n<ul>\n<li>Graduate/Postgraduate in IT or relevant field.</li>\n<li>Minimum 4 years of experience in the field.</li>\n<li>Preferred certifications: AWS, Azure, or equivalent.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.8362%; text-align: center;\">Chief Manager</td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.1638%;\">\n<ul>\n<li>Bachelor’s/Master’s degree in a relevant field from a recognized university.</li>\n<li>Minimum 6 years of experience in the relevant domain.</li>\n<li>Certifications in project management or related fields are preferred.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To apply</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Candidates can apply through link https://www.centralbankofindia.co.in/ or provided below in link section or they can also apply through official site of the Central Bank before Last Date.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">You Can Check other <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sarkari Result 2025</a> Notification Here – <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Check Now.</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">For all the interested and eligible candidates who want to apply for Central Bank Specialist Officer recruitment can read all the information related to the recruitment is given below and the link to apply is given in the Important Link section below.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Online Examination</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Interview&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariExam on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://instagram.com/sarkariexam.com_?igshid=YmMyMTA2M2Y=\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Follow Now</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><